Welcome to AILANG Parse!
========================

Your API key has been provisioned and you're ready to start parsing documents.

Getting Started
---------------

1. Install the SDK:
   pip install ailang-parse

2. Parse your first document:
   from ailang_parse import parse
   result = parse("report.docx", output="markdown")

3. Try the WASM demo (no API key needed):
   https://sunholo.com/ailang-parse/#demo

Your Plan: Free Tier
--------------------
- 1,000 requests/month
- 1,000 units/month
- 10 MB max file size
- Deterministic formats only (DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, CSV, MD)

To parse PDFs, images, audio, or video, upgrade to Pro ($29/mo):
https://sunholo.com/docparse/dashboard.html

Supported Formats
-----------------
Deterministic: DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, HTML, CSV, TSV, Markdown, EPUB, ODT, ODP, ODS, EML
AI-Powered:    PDF, PNG, JPG, MP3, WAV, MP4, MOV

Need help? Reply to this email or check our docs:
https://sunholo.com/ailang-parse/

Happy parsing!
— The AILANG Team

